# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# Database backups from scripts/backup_db.py.
#
# Never commit these. They are a full dump of operational state — treasury
# balances, every recorded observation, settings — and git keeps deleted content
# forever, so one accidental commit puts the whole history in the repo
# permanently even after a later removal. Back up to disk or object storage,
# not to version control.
backups/

